WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
(audience applauds)

00:00:04.402 --> 00:00:06.922
(tense music)

00:00:06.922 --> 00:00:08.890
- I feel American

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.220
until I'm around something very American,

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.546
and then I'm like, "I don't like this."

00:00:12.546 --> 00:00:14.473
(audience laughs)

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:18.450
Something about the American
flag is just too American.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.220
I feel the same way
about the American flag

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.820
that I imagine white people
feel about Black people.

00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:26.095
I don't want to be around a lot of them.

00:00:26.095 --> 00:00:29.012
(audience laughs)

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.070
Three or four is fine.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:33.903
That's plenty.

00:00:33.903 --> 00:00:36.833
But I don't, you know, I
don't want to be surrounded.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:41.267
Even "The National Anthem,"
"The National Anthem,"

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:43.620
when I hear "The National Anthem,"

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.660
you know what it feels like?

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.012
It feels like I'm
listening to R. Kelly now.

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:49.845
(audience laughs)

00:00:52.797 --> 00:00:54.130
It's still good.

00:00:57.024 --> 00:00:58.357
It's still good.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.028
It's just hard to not think
about that other thing.

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:05.028
(audience applauds)

00:01:07.381 --> 00:01:10.048
(logo whooshes)

